//! vector-admission law. Source: tracel-ai/cubecl PR #1922 "fix: check every
//! outer stride before vectorizing tensor reads" (laggui), MERGED
//! 2026-10-26T20:10:36Z, merge `5bd6d17aa883276bf4cf76eadb8ad518c4799647`,
//! 3 files +61/−15 (crates/cubecl-core/src/lib.rs
